OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA warm
OL,6,Fevening with some late sunshine in
OL,7,Fplaces but also a chance of locally
OL,8,Fheavy showers. Many places missing
OL,9,Fthese though and staying dry
OL,10,Fthroughout the evening and night.
OL,11,FRemaining warm and humid, especially
OL,12,Fin urban areas.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FA mostly dry day with
OL,15,Fplenty of warm sunny spells. Isolated
OL,16,Fbrief showers are possible, mainly in
OL,17,Fthe afternoon. Much breezier and
OL,18,Ffeeling considerably cooler than
OL,19,Frecently.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
